From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:22:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mmc: sunxi: Keep the A733 SD controller off the eMMC features

The A733 SD controller (SMHC0) runs with the configuration that was
written for the eMMC: the card threshold, the automatic CMD23, the
HS400 timing and the data strobe delay. The user manual describes
SMHC0 and SMHC1 as 4-bit SD/SDIO controllers and gives HS400 and the
data strobe to the 8-bit eMMC controllers only, and the driver writes
the HS400 registers of the SD controller at every clock change.

Leave the SD and SDIO controllers on the features they have in common
with the eMMC controller: FIFO thresholds, the auto-CMD12 argument, the
busy wait in the host and the host software queue. The eMMC controller
keeps its own configuration.

Not covered: SMHC1 (SDIO) is not used on any board yet.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: the SD controller ran at SDR104 without
CMD23, its card threshold stayed off after reads and it read the same
data twice; the eMMC controller kept both features and HS400.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c | 6 ++----
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c b/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
index 017c85a87d64..3bf1a7e5e5d9 100644
--- a/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
+++ b/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
@@ -2061,6 +2061,7 @@ static const struct sunxi_mmc_cfg sun50i_a100_emmc_cfg = {
 	.needs_new_timings = true,
 };
 
+/* SMHC0 and SMHC1: SD and SDIO, 4 bit, no HS400 */
 static const struct sunxi_mmc_cfg sun60i_a733_cfg = {
 	.idma_des_size_bits = 13,
 	.idma_des_shift = 2,
@@ -2070,15 +2071,12 @@ static const struct sunxi_mmc_cfg sun60i_a733_cfg = {
 	.no_ceata_funs = true,
 	/* burst 16, RX trigger level 15, TX trigger level 240 */
 	.fifoth = 0x300f00f0,
-	.can_auto_cmd23 = true,
-	.thld_fifo_bytes = 1024,
-	.can_hs400 = true,
-	.ds_dl = 20,
 	.needs_a12a_init = true,
 	.can_wait_busy = true,
 	.can_hsq = true,
 };
 
+/* SMHC2 and SMHC3: eMMC, 8 bit, HS400 */
 static const struct sunxi_mmc_cfg sun60i_a733_emmc_cfg = {
 	.idma_des_size_bits = 13,
 	.idma_des_shift = 2,
